<title>JAPAN: TSE says seeks to list Japan Wavelock.</title>
<headline>TSE says seeks to list Japan Wavelock.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Japan Wavelock Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Japan Wavelock is likely to be listed on December 20 and it plans to issue 1.1 million new shares, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Japan Wavelock, now traded on the over-the-counter (OTC) market, is a maker of fibre-reinforced plastic sheets.</p>
